'''Pantoran City''' was the [[capital]] [[city]] of the [[moon]] [[Pantora]]. The government of Pantora, the [[Pantoran Assembly]], governed the moon from Pantoran City.<ref name="BMF 85" /> The city had many high buildings with parks on top of their roofs.<ref name="Dark Disciple" />

